<title>CROATIA: Croatia M1 money supply up 8.5 pct in July mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Croatia M1 money supply up 8.5 pct in July mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	    JULY	  JUNE	 JULY'95</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK) 7,706.0     7,124.5	6,174.0</p>
<p> Money M1 supply		10,198.4     9,396.8	8,510.7</p>
<p> -Currency outside banks     4,001.0     3,577.0	3,273.0</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	    13,005.0    12,085.0     10,631.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- July reserve money rose 8.2 percent from July and 14.3 percent year-on-year. M1 jumped 8.5 percent on a monthly basis and 23.2 percent on an annual level.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
